    {
      "id": "C17-D16-S02",
      "sourceText": "[D16新编匿名Development]\n请在10月20日前核对迎新志愿者分组，页面显示核对完成；另于10月22日前上传场地使用承诺函，场地使用承诺函须为PNG，平台显示承诺函已收妥。两项分别办理。",
      "sourceSha256": "91618a256c8d2164f54ff274636ef5c790e5d3990d99ee7e2520ddc115fa1bdf",
      "assistedId": "d21-record-03",
      "manualId": "d13-fixture-manual-d23-s02",
      "stimulusSha256": "45b6477598761938c10e44f20b5c16d4997b201ed46794c3fad35899b68c7a7d",
      "kind": "RECORDED_MODEL",
      "coverage": [
        "multi",
        "date_only",
        "material"
      ],
      "ordinal": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "C17-D16-S04",
      "sourceText": "[D16新编匿名Development]\n列入决赛彩排名单的同学须出席辩论决赛彩排，以完成辩论决赛彩排为准。你的队伍未列入决赛彩排名单，本通知不要求你出席。",
      "sourceSha256": "9225590c3aa495e23dea327641798bcfae451f83adc430d2a9b122f206e2a29d",
      "assistedId": "d21-record-07",
      "manualId": "d13-fixture-manual-d23-s04",
      "stimulusSha256": "fc0666b26a2956cc476985e7ca1c19304989045153f03bf3e5f9eebecbec9fb5",
      "kind": "RECORDED_MODEL",
      "coverage": [
        "condition_false",
        "inactive"
